# Optional: Override the API base URL.
# By default the dashboard infers the API URL from the browser's current
# hostname/protocol (e.g. http://192.168.1.10:3001).
# Set this when the API is on a different host, behind a reverse proxy,
# or served over HTTPS with a custom domain.
#
# Examples:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3001
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.bloxos.example.com
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
